HookExecutorRelayTest
├── when the message is shorter than a burn message
│   └── it should revert
├── when the message version is wrong
│   └── it should revert
├── when the source domain is not Solana
│   └── it should revert
├── when the header sender is not the configured Solana token messenger
│   └── it should revert
├── when the header recipient is not the configured local token messenger
│   └── it should revert
├── when the destination caller is not the executor
│   └── it should revert
├── when the burn token is not the configured USDC mint
│   └── it should revert
├── when the mint recipient is not the executor
│   └── it should revert
├── when the attestation is invalid
│   └── it should revert and leave the nonce unprocessed
├── when the message was already processed
│   └── it should revert
└── when the message is valid
    ├── it should credit the net minted amount after the CCTP fee
    ├── given the hook data is well formed
    │   ├── given the deadline has passed
    │   │   └── it should hold the USDC as a claim for the beneficiary
    │   ├── given the vault rejects the deposit
    │   │   └── it should hold the USDC as a claim and clear the allowance
    │   └── given the vault accepts the deposit
    │       └── it should record a vault deposit request for the beneficiary
    └── given the hook data is malformed
        └── it should quarantine the USDC under the nonce
